@node System audio
@chapter System audio

SSS favors modern technologies and thus makes use of Pipewire for all your GNU/Linux audio needs.

In practice this means that any user account in your system that wants to make use of audio, should have the  @code{(service home-dbus-service-type)} and @code{(service home-pipewire-service-type)} services enabled for their account (yes per-user basis).

You will also want to set the @code{RTC_USE_PIPEWIRE} variable to @code{true}. This is already the case by default in SSS@.

